  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Solomon Islands Program Support (ASIPS+) Facility  2023-2031</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ASIPS Facility Support Unit provides logistical and operational support to DFAT and provides resources to deliver sector programs (for example in education, health, gender equality, civil society and other small grants). This Service Order has two outcomes: 1) Deliver responsive, scalable, efficient and quality operational, logistical and administrative support services and 2) Sector programs are effective and address cross-cutting and safeguards issues.</narrative>
  </description>
